            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
              <div class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-500">5-Star Review Funnel</div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-900">Turn happy customers into 5-star reviews, automatically.</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">Build the reputation that wins more jobs, with zero extra work for you or your crew.</p>
              <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-slate-700">
                <li>• Automated review requests</li>
                <li>• Negative feedback filtered</li>
                <li>• Google review boost</li>
                <li>• Reputation monitoring</li>
