            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
            <div class="bg-slate-100 p-4">
              <img src="https://vibe.filesafe.space/1785706415045236708/attachments/c3a1cc7e-f0ca-4319-8412-e18f35e7f309.png" alt="Missed Call Text Back Mockup" class="mx-auto h-48 w-full max-w-xs rounded-xl object-contain" />
            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
              <div class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-500">Missed Call Text Back</div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-900">Never lose another lead to voicemail.</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">Miss a call and an instant text goes out automatically, keeping the customer engaged until you can follow up.</p>
              <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-slate-700">
                <li>• Instant text response</li>
                <li>• Custom messaging</li>
                <li>• Lead capture</li>
                <li>• 24/7 coverage</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
            <div class="bg-slate-100 p-4">
              <img src="https://vibe.filesafe.space/1785706415045236708/attachments/c17c583d-a6ea-4eb4-b312-1489d9caa75d.png" alt="Revenue Campaigns Mockup" class="mx-auto h-48 w-full max-w-xs rounded-xl object-contain" />
            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
              <div class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-500">Revenue Campaigns</div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-900">Turn past customers into repeat business.</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">Stay top-of-mind with strategic email and SMS campaigns that drive repeat jobs and referrals on autopilot.</p>
              <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-slate-700">
                <li>• Email campaigns</li>
                <li>• Seasonal promotions</li>
                <li>• SMS marketing</li>
                <li>• Customer retention</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
            <div class="bg-slate-100 p-4">
              <img src="https://vibe.filesafe.space/1785706415045236708/attachments/d371f79f-7d92-48b3-af71-fdd790709aa4.png" alt="Local SEO Mockup" class="mx-auto h-48 w-full max-w-xs rounded-xl object-contain" />
            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
              <div class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-500">Local SEO</div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-900">Show up first when customers search for you.</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">Get more calls from people in your area who are already searching and ready to hire.</p>
              <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-slate-700">
                <li>• Google Business optimization</li>
                <li>• Citation building</li>
                <li>• Local keyword ranking</li>
                <li>• Map pack visibility</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
