        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[28px] border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-7 shadow-sm">
          <div class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-accent-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-accent-700">Bonus #2</div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-900">30 Days of DFY Content</h3>
          <div class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-accent-600">$1,000 Value</div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600">A full month of done-for-you social media content tailored to your brand to build trust and authority in your local market without lifting a finger.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-[#1A1D27] py-20 text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-(--breakpoint-xl) px-5">
      <div class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-3xl text-center">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-white/70">PART OF YOUR SYSTEM</div>
