      </div>

      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl rounded-[32px] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-8 text-center shadow-xl">
        <p class="text-lg text-white/75 md:text-xl">24/7 AI-powered agents that answer calls, follow up with leads via text, book appointments, and qualify prospects — even when you're on the job site. Never miss another opportunity.</p>
        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 text-left sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-4"><div class="text-sm font-semibold text-accent-400">✔</div><div class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/80">Answer calls 24/7</div></div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-4"><div class="text-sm font-semibold text-accent-400">✔</div><div class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/80">Follow up with leads</div></div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-4"><div class="text-sm font-semibold text-accent-400">✔</div><div class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/80">Book appointments</div></div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-4"><div class="text-sm font-semibold text-accent-400">✔</div><div class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/80">Qualify prospects</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center">
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-500 px-8 text-base font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-accent-600">Request a Website</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-[#F8F9FA] py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-(--breakpoint-xl) px-5">
      <div class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-3xl text-center">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 shadow-sm">REAL RESULTS</div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl font-black leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.06em] text-primary-900 md:text-5xl">Real Businesses. Real Numbers.</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600">Every stat below comes from a documented case study — click through to see exactly what we did and how it was measured.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
